wide-media"><div class="WebPage-text WebPage-text_interactive"><a href="https://forms.gle/Au8p2zfKSRXsozQZ8" title="https://forms.gle/Au8p2zfKSRXsozQZ8" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="site-name" dir="auto" data-entity-type="MessageEntityUrl">Google Docs</a><p class="site-title">تسليم Project 3 - تطوير البرمجيات Python</p><p class="site-description">تسليم البروجكت قبل موعد انتهاء التسليم يوم الاحد الساعة 5:29م الموافق 2026\8\30<br><br>تذكير يجب وضع المشروع القيت هب برايفت كذلك اعطاء صلاحية لي ولاستاذ فيصل عبر القيت هب: <br>حس...</p></div><div class="media-inner n7fx0dq4 s8sR0xJD interactive" style="--media-width: 1200px; --media-aspect-ratio: 1.9047619047619047;"><canvas class="thumbnail blurred-bg" width="40" height="21"></canvas><canvas class="thumbnail opacity-transition slow shown open" width="40" height="21"></canvas></div></div></div></div><span class="MessageMeta" dir="ltr" data-ignore-on-paste="true"><span class="message-time">04:11&nbsp;PM</span><div class="MessageOutgoingStatus"><div class="Transition"><div class="Transition_slide Transition_slide-active"><i class="icon icon-message-succeeded" aria-hidden="true"></i></div></div></div></span><div class="message-action-buttons-container"><div class="message-action-buttons-sticky-zone"><div class="message-action-buttons message-action-button-sticky"></div></div><div class="message-action-buttons"></div></div><svg width="9" height="20" class="svg-appendix"><defs><filter x="-50%" y="-14.7%" width="200%" height="141.2%" filterUnits="objectBoundingBox" id="messageAppendix"><feoffset dy="1" in="SourceAlpha" result="shadowOffsetOuter1"></feoffset><fegaussianblur stdDeviation="1" in="shadowOffsetOuter1" result="shadowBlurOuter1"></fegaussianblur><fecolormatrix values="0 0 0 0 0.0621962482 0 0 0 0 0.138574144 0 0 0 0 0.185037364 0 0 0 0.15 0" in="shadowBlurOuter1"></fecolormatrix></filter></defs><g fill="none" fill-rule="evenodd"><path d="M6 17H0V0c.193 2.84.876 5.767 2.05 8.782.904 2.325 2.446 4.485